# The functions of Mission_FirstContactPress in level downtown (the script levels/downtown/scripts/mission_firstcontactpress.py of Data.packed) that are data: one section
# per function, its parameters after the name. The other functions of the script stay Python: InitStatus.
# Made by a converter from the script. A pack in mods/ with scrapc/levels/downtown/mission_firstcontactpress.def replaces this file.
section Init LevelPath
